  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DIGICIRCLE4ALL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to unite Dutch and South African Impact Cluster partners, job seekers, entrepreneurs and corporates to bridge the digital divide in South Africa. By establishing a sustainable and closed-loop IT-value chain, refurbishing and redistributing IT devices, promoting sustainable practices, and fostering circular economy knowledge, the project aspires to make digital access more inclusive, affordable, and sustainable, while strengthening the circular economy practices of the South African private sector.</narrative>
  </description>
